### Putting things together

$\begin{align}
&\phantom{=}\dfrac{d}{dx}\left(\cos(e^x)\right)
\\\\
&=\dfrac{d}{dx}\left[v\Bigl(u(x)\Bigr)\right]&&\gray{\text{Let }u(x)=e^x\text{, }v(x)=\cos(x)}
\\\\
&=v'\Bigl(u(x)\Bigr)\cdot u'(x)&&\gray{\text{The chain rule}}
\\\\
&=\blueD{-\sin(e^x)}\cdot \maroonC{e^x}
\\\\
&=-e^x\sin(e^x)
\end{align}$
